      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "+1 to the replies below, have to parse as string as split it manually and then add it as a decimal and non-decimal part. Otherwise for people on French locale `float.Parse` will crash the udon behaviour completely if `.` is used as a delimiter. While using `,` will make it so it parses `1,75` as `175` which makes all the timings wrong.\nThis is really needed.",
